qpid-proton
------------------------------------------
Qpid Proton is a high-performance, lightweight messaging library. It can be
used in the widest range of messaging applications, including brokers, client
libraries, routers, bridges, proxies, and more. Proton makes it trivial to
integrate with the AMQP 1.0 ecosystem from any platform, environment, or
language.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libjsoncpp27-1.9.8-1
  libqpid-proton-core-devel-0.41.1-1bl1
  libqpid-proton-core10-0.41.1-1bl1
  libqpid-proton-cpp-devel-0.41.1-1bl1
  libqpid-proton-cpp12-0.41.1-1bl1
  libqpid-proton-devel-0.41.1-1bl1
  libqpid-proton-proactor-devel-0.41.1-1bl1
  libqpid-proton-proactor1-0.41.1-1bl1
  libqpid-proton11-0.41.1-1bl1
  libsasl2_3-2.1.27-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libuv1-1.53.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

