Canonical website:
  https://github.com/apache/qpid-proton/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/apache/qpid-proton/archive/refs/tags/0.41.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack qpid-proton-0.41.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./qpid-proton-0.41.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/qpid-proton-0.41.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/qpid-proton-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton11-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton-devel-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton-core10-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton-core-devel-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton-cpp12-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton-cpp-devel-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton-proactor1-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqpid-proton-proactor-devel-0.41.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-qpid-proton-0.41.1-X.tar.xz

